1923 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 1924 0 R/Alt(Block diagram. A designer sends prompts to an LLM agent and reviews its work. The agent edits a chip project based on the AMS chip template and runs its make targets, which call the tools of the IIC-OSIC-TOOLS. The results flow back to the agent and the designer, the agent reads and writes a knowledge base, and all changes go through Git and GitHub. Dashed arrows show that the designer can also edit the project and check the tool results by hand with make open.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[27]/Pg 31158 0 R>>
endobj
