<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 12803 0 R/Alt(Timing diagram over eight clock cycles. clk_i has a rising edge between all cycles. For circuit (a), slow_clk_q is high in cycles 2, 3, 6 and 7, with each edge shortly after the rising edge of clk_i, and led_o is high from cycle 2 to cycle 5, with each edge later than the edge of slow_clk_q. For circuit (b), tick is high in cycles 1 and 5, and led_o is high from cycle 2 to cycle 5, both with each edge shortly after the rising edge of clk_i.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 31251 0 R>>
