<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 24204 0 R/Alt(Transistor schematic. From VDD at the top, the PMOS XP0 with gate A and the PMOS XP1 with gate B are connected in series through the internal net net1 down to the output node Y. From Y, the NMOS XN0 with gate A and the NMOS XN1 with gate B are connected in parallel down to VSS. Y also leads to the right as the output. XP0 and XN0 are drawn in red.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 31381 0 R>>
